[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on a lift\nand raise it.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the dust protection.</p><p>2. Remove the dust protection.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045269.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the protection \nis not damaged.</p><p>Place the protection in position and secure\nit using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a></p>"]]